<title>CANADA: DBRS confirms Abitibi-Price ratings.</title>
<headline>DBRS confirms Abitibi-Price ratings.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dominion Bond Rating Service said on Tuesday it confirmed the ratings on Abitibi-Price Inc's sinking fund debentures, preferred shares and commercial paper at BBB, Pfd-3 and R-2(high) respectively, with stable trends.</p>
<p>DBRS said newsprint prices and the company's earnings appear to have peaked for the current cycle but profitability is expected to remain reasonable into 1997 as industry-wide downtime cuts newsprint inventories and stabilizes prices.</p>
<p>It said the balance sheet continues to be reasonable and the company is well positioned for the eventual cyclical downturn.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
